<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. Review of this user's history of activity on Reddit reveals dozens of posts discussing the user's anxiety over connecting with others and their failed attempts at doing so.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-3')">3</a>. Ms. Ferver had some buildup of fungal growths encroaching on her airways in the throat region.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. <em>Nälkä</em> holy book concerning the teachings and mythos of Grand Karcist Ion.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-5"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-5')">5</a>. Based on her translation and analysis of the <em>Solomonari Valkzaron</em>.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-6"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-6')">6</a>. Experts in thaumaturgical analysis and defusal of thaumaturgical countermeasures.</div>
